  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Host Wen Simo launches into the opening monologue of Entertainment Talk and welcomes an overseas comedy star, when the guest's interpreter suddenly collapses from a honey allergy. Listen to the studio emergency first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "新版的文娱论终于跟大家见面了，大家好，我是闻思默。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "没错，从这期开始，这档节目就由我来主持。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "跟老朋友们都是老交情了，如果看烦了，那也别说出来啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "今天我们的节目有幸请到了一位重量级的嘉宾。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "他就是来自泰国著名的喜剧大咖米娜先生，掌声欢迎！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "这几年咱们中泰两国在文化领域上的合作愈加频繁。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "林姐，停一下，您怎么回事？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "他蜂蜜过敏，工作餐里有蜂蜜！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "星天有合作的医院，对吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "有凯文的应急预案，快快快！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "车呢？车已经到了，快送医院！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "新版的文娱论终于跟大家见面了，大家好，我是闻思默。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The revamped Entertainment Talk is finally back—hello everyone, I am Wen Simo.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "没错，从这期开始，这档节目就由我来主持。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That is right—starting from this episode, I will be hosting this show.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "跟老朋友们都是老交情了，如果看烦了，那也别说出来啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We are all old friends by now, so even if you get tired of seeing me, keep it to yourself.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "今天我们的节目有幸请到了一位重量级的嘉宾。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Today our programme is honoured to welcome a heavyweight guest.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "他就是来自泰国著名的喜剧大咖米娜先生，掌声欢迎！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He is Thailand's renowned comedy star Mr Mina—let us welcome him with applause!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "这几年咱们中泰两国在文化领域上的合作愈加频繁。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'In recent years, cultural cooperation between China and Thailand has grown ever more frequent.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "林姐，停一下，您怎么回事？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Lin Jie, hold the cameras—what is wrong over there?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "他蜂蜜过敏，工作餐里有蜂蜜！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He is allergic to honey, and there was honey in the crew meal!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "星天有合作的医院，对吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xingtian has a partner hospital nearby, right?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "有凯文的应急预案，快快快！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We have Kaiwen's emergency contingency plan—hurry!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "车呢？车已经到了，快送医院！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Where is the car? The car is right outside—rush him to the hospital!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "新版的文娱论终于跟大家见面了，大家好，我是闻思默。",
      "gap": 0.5
